  "bodyHash": "sHcSY975cvc=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">溢出的血量條</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 將 Minecraft 的生命值、護甲值和護甲強度值在保留原版風格的同時擴展，使其保持緊湊且易於閱讀。此模組並未增加額外的圖示行數，而是將條狀顯示疊加為清晰的層次，大幅節省空間。📊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">當你的數值超過原版上限時，層數計數器會精確顯示你擁有幾層生命值、護甲或護甲強度。無需記憶顏色方案或猜測當前查看的是哪一層。🔢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組還新增了一個專用的護甲強度條，將這個重要的防禦屬性顯示在 HUD 上，而原版遊戲並未提供此功能。🛡️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要完整支援超過原版上限的護甲和護甲強度值，請安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">AttributeFix</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（作者 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/DarkhaxDev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">DarkhaxDev</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。🌟</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">緊湊生命顯示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 將生命值疊加顯示，超越十顆心的上限，無需在 HUD 上增加額外行數。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">超越原版上限的護甲：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以最少的空間顯示高護甲值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">護甲強度條：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 新增專用的護甲強度顯示，讓你隨時掌握這個重要的防禦屬性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔢 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">清晰的層數計數器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 每個疊加條均可顯示數字指示器，精確指出當前的層數。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">易於辨識的顏色：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用原版顏色作為基底層，並以單一強調色標示疊加層，避免令人困惑的彩虹色顯示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📏 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">節省空間的 HUD：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 即使生命值、護甲或護甲強度極高，仍保持緊湊顯示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">聊天相容性修正：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 防止聊天訊息遮擋護甲相關的 HUD 元素。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可自訂佈局：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 調整位置、疊加行為、計數器及顯示選項，以符合你偏好的 HUD 設定。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端必須安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可直接在遊戲中透過模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，作者 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有設定檔均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，並根據設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有類型都會存在於每個模組中，甚至可能完全沒有設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/locusway\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">LocusWay</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overpowered-armor-bar\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Overpowered Armor Bar</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組啟發了分層護甲條的靈感。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Vazkii\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Vazkii</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Quark</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組啟發了護甲與護甲強度的疊加圖示。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cadaverous_queen\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">cadaverous_queen</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rustic\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Rustic</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組提供了護甲強度圖示以及該條的原始概念。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mdiyo\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">mDiyo</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mantle</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組最初提出了疊加心形顯示的構想。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-windows\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwindows/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/new-health-bars\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/healthbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
